
### MyBatis-Plus demo variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@mpStudentId = 9002


### MP selectById
GET {{baseUrl}}/mp/students/{{mpStudentId}}


### MP insert
POST {{baseUrl}}/mp/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{mpStudentId}}",
  "name": "MP Demo Student",
  "age": 19,
  "score": 86
}


### MP updateById
PUT {{baseUrl}}/mp/students/{{mpStudentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MP Demo Updated",
  "age": 20,
  "score": 92
}


### MP LambdaQueryWrapper condition query
GET {{baseUrl}}/mp/students?name=MP&minScore=80&maxScore=100


### MP page query
GET {{baseUrl}}/mp/students/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=5&name=MP&minScore=80&maxScore=100


### MP deleteById
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/mp/students/{{mpStudentId}}


### MP selectById after delete, should return 没有该学生
GET {{baseUrl}}/mp/students/{{mpStudentId}}
